      "comment": "BING BING JET (2) shows ability but remains a maiden after seven starts. Hit the frame again last start finishing second (27.77) at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Overdue and expected to feature again. WEST ON DASHER (5) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing 5 lengths behind Bing Bing Zoom in 28.06 and recording a new PB here. Expected to feature again. WEST ON GEMMA (8) comes off an average run last start when eighth at this track over 400m behind Whacky Do (23.74) in a Maiden. Was in the money the start prior. Worth another chance. WEST ON JACE (7) is likely to have admirers.",
